# ============================================================================
# AI Image & Video Generator - Environment Configuration
# ============================================================================

# ============================================================================
# IMAGE GENERATION PROVIDERS
# ============================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gemini 2.5 Flash Image (Nano Banana) - Default, Recommended
# Provider: Google AI Studio
# Model: gemini-2.5-flash-image
# Nickname: "Nano Banana" (official Google branding)
# Pricing: ~$0.04-0.06 per image
# Resolution: 1024px (10 aspect ratios)
# Best for: High-volume, low-latency, fast iteration
# Get key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Docs: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-google-api-key-here
GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash-image

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gemini 3 Pro Image Preview (Nano Banana Pro)
# Provider: Google AI Studio
# Model: gemini-3-pro-image-preview
# Nickname: "Nano Banana Pro" (official Google branding)
# Pricing: ~$0.10-0.15 per image
# Resolution: 1K/2K/4K configurable
# Features: Professional quality, "thinking" mode, real-world grounding
# Best for: Professional asset production, complex instructions, 4K output
# Get key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Docs: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GEMINI_PRO_IMAGE_MODEL=gemini-3-pro-image-preview

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Imagen 3.0 (Best for specific aspect ratios)
# Provider: Google Cloud Vertex AI
# Model: imagen-3.0-generate-001
# Pricing: ~$0.04 per image (1024x1024), ~$0.08 per image (higher res)
# Requires: Google Cloud Project + Application Default Credentials
# Setup: gcloud auth application-default login
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
VERTEX_LOCATION=us-central1
VERTEX_IMAGEN_MODEL=imagen-3.0-generate-001

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenAI DALL-E (Cheapest option)
# Provider: OpenAI
# Model Options: gpt-image-1-mini | dall-e-2 | dall-e-3 | gpt-image-1
# Pricing:
#   - gpt-image-1-mini: ~$0.01-0.02 per image (CHEAPEST, 80% cost reduction)
#   - dall-e-2: $0.02 per image (1024x1024)
#   - dall-e-3: $0.04 per image (1024x1024), $0.08 (1024x1792/1792x1024)
#   - gpt-image-1: ~$0.10 per image (highest quality)
# Get key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1-mini
OPENAI_IMAGE_SIZE=1024x1024

# ============================================================================
# VIDEO GENERATION PROVIDERS
# ============================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Veo 2.0 (Production video generation)
# Provider: Google Cloud Vertex AI
# Model: veo-2.0-generate-001
# Pricing: ~$0.10-0.20 per second of video (varies by resolution/duration)
#   - Typical 5-second video: ~$0.50-1.00
# Requires: Google Cloud Project + GCS Bucket for temp storage
# Setup: Create GCS bucket with lifecycle policy for auto-cleanup
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
VERTEX_VEO_MODEL=veo-2.0-generate-001
VERTEX_VEO_OUTPUT_BUCKET=gs://your-bucket-name/videos/

# ============================================================================
# OPTIONAL: ORGANIZATION/PROJECT IDs (OpenAI)
# ============================================================================
# OPENAI_ORG_ID=org-xxxxxxxxxx
# OPENAI_PROJECT_ID=proj-xxxxxxxxxx

# ============================================================================
# NOTES
# ============================================================================
# 1. "Nano Banana" Branding:
#    - "Nano Banana" = Gemini 2.5 Flash Image (official Google nickname)
#    - "Nano Banana Pro" = Gemini 3 Pro Image Preview (official Google nickname)
#    - These are NOT third-party services - they're Google's official models!
#
# 2. Pricing is approximate and subject to change. Check official pricing:
#    - Google AI: https://ai.google.dev/pricing
#    - Vertex AI: https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/pricing
#    - OpenAI: https://openai.com/pricing
#
# 3. Cost comparison (per image, approximate):
#    - gpt-image-1-mini: $0.01-0.02 (CHEAPEST)
#    - dall-e-2: $0.02
#    - Imagen 3.0: $0.04
#    - Gemini 2.5 Flash (Nano Banana): $0.04-0.06 (BEST VALUE)
#    - dall-e-3: $0.04-0.08
#    - gpt-image-1: $0.10
#    - Gemini 3 Pro (Nano Banana Pro): $0.10-0.15 (PREMIUM/4K)
#
# 4. Provider recommendations:
#    - Development/testing: OpenAI gpt-image-1-mini ($0.01-0.02)
#    - Production (fast): Gemini 2.5 Flash / Nano Banana ($0.04-0.06)
#    - Production (quality): Imagen 3.0 ($0.04-0.08)
#    - Professional/4K: Gemini 3 Pro / Nano Banana Pro ($0.10-0.15)
#
# 5. Resolution support:
#    Gemini 2.5 Flash (Nano Banana):
#      - 1024px base resolution
#      - 10 aspect ratios: 1:1, 2:3, 3:2, 3:4, 4:3, 4:5, 5:4, 9:16, 16:9, 21:9
#    
#    Gemini 3 Pro (Nano Banana Pro):
#      - 1K/2K/4K configurable (up to 4096x4096 for 1:1)
#      - Same 10 aspect ratios
#      - Professional quality with "thinking" mode
#    
#    Imagen 3.0:
#      - Fixed aspect ratios: 1:1, 3:4, 4:3, 9:16, 16:9
#      - Via Vertex AI
#    
#    OpenAI:
#      - 1024x1024, 512x512, 1792x1024
#
# 6. Cost optimization tips:
#    - Use --images-only flag to review images before video generation
#    - Use --dry-run to preview operations without API calls
#    - Set OPENAI_IMAGE_SIZE=256x256 for dev (faster, cheaper)
#    - Use --force-regen sparingly to avoid regenerating existing images
#    - Use Gemini 2.5 Flash for high-volume production (best value)
#    - Use gpt-image-1-mini for absolute lowest cost
#
# 7. Authentication:
#    - Google API Key: Direct from AI Studio (for Gemini models)
#    - Google Cloud: Run 'gcloud auth application-default login' (for Vertex AI)
#    - OpenAI: Bearer token from platform.openai.com
